==Fresh Baked Muffins==
*This type of quest requires using 'Baked Muffins' (and not bought) for the 'Fresh Baked Muffins' series of quest listed below.
** You will need * [[Baking]] (Trivial: 135)
** '''Yield: Muffin''' x6
** In [[Oven]]:
:: {{SmIcon|1036}} 1 x [[Muffin Tin]] - Crafted, Returned on Failure, Returned on Success
:: {{SmIcon|1090}} 1 x [[Clump of Dough]] - Crafted
:: {{SmIcon|1037}} 1 x [[Fruit]] - Foraged

* Please Note: that baked [[Muffin]] will look exactly like the vendor sold kind. Even identify spell does not distinguish the two but one will combine in the muffin crate and the vendor sold kind will not. So they are in fact two different item IDs<br>

 
===To get a [[Muffin Crate]] See [[Gretta Mottle]] in South [[Kaladim]]===
'''Only [[Gretta Mottle]] in Kaladim will still respond to acquire [[Muffin Crate]] to initiate this quest, but the [[Full Muffin Crate]] can still be handed in to any of the Innkeepers related to the Bread Shipment quests listed below.'''<br>
You say, 'Hail, Gretta Mottle'
:Gretta Mottle says, 'Greetings, <player>. I'm Gretta Mottle. Tumpy has been kind enough to let me set up my bakery in his fine establishment here. Unfortunately, with that nasty plague corruptin' the crops in the Plains of Karana, things are going' a big slot for me. I keep runnin' out of bread and muffins to sell. Because of flour bein' easily spoiled now, it takes longer to make 'em just right. My assistant Buggle is still learnin cow to cook. Hehe.. All he can make is Meat Pie. If I don't get any [help to bake] soon I won't be able to keep the supply up with the demand.'
You say, 'I will help to bake'
:Gretta Mottle says, 'Glad to hear it. Are ye thinkin' of helpin' me to [bake muffins] or did ye want to [fetch some bread] for me?'
You say, 'bake muffins'
:Gretta Mottle says, 'Ah, if ye want to help me with the bakin', take this Muffin Crate, fill it up with some of your freshly baked Muffins, then seal them in so they won't become stale. I sure hope you can make 'em good enough.'

You receive [[Muffin Crate]]!<br>
'''Fill this container with 10 unstacked Muffins that were baked and Combine into a [[Full Muffin Crate]]. You can hand this back to Gretta to complete [[Fresh Baked Muffins (Kaladim)]] or you can hand it into any of the other towns Innkeepers that are related to the bread Shipment quests listed below.
'''

